        <p>To discuss a matter, call <a href="tel:+14082099112">+1 (408) 209-9112</a> or email <!--email_off--><a href="mailto:tlavian@telecommnet.com">tlavian@telecommnet.com</a><!--/email_off-->. Dr. Lavian is based in Encino, California and is available for engagements nationwide.</p>
        <p class="cta-links"><a class="cta-button" href="/contact/">Contact Dr. Lavian</a> <a class="cta-link" href="/Dr-Tal-Lavian-CV-Expert-Witness-Network-Communications-Telecommunications-Internet-Protocols-Mobile-Wireless-2026.pdf">Curriculum Vitae (PDF)</a></p>
      </aside>

    </div>
  </div>

  <style is:global>
    .expertise-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 20px;
      margin: 25px 0;
    }
    .expertise-card {
      background: #f8fafc;
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      border-top: 3px solid #c8850a;
      padding: 25px 20px;
      border-radius: 0 0 4px 4px;
    }
    .expertise-card h3 {
      color: #1a365d;
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }
    .expertise-card h3 a {
      color: #1a365d;
      text-decoration: underline;
    }
    .expertise-card h3 a:hover {
      color: #c8850a;
    }
    .expertise-card ul {
      list-style: none;
      padding: 0;
      margin: 0;
    }
    .expertise-card ul li {
      padding: 6px 0 6px 28px;
      position: relative;
      font-size: 0.92rem;
      line-height: 1.5;
      color: #333;
    }
    .expertise-card ul li::before {
      content: "\2714";
      color: #2b8a6f;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      position: absolute;
      left: 4px;
      top: 7px;
    }
    .exploring-list {
      list-style-type: disc;
      padding-left: 20px;
    }
    .exploring-list li {
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }
    .exploring-list li strong {
      display: inline;
    }
    @media (max-width: 992px) {
      .expertise-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      }
    }
    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .expertise-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }
  </style>

</BaseLayout>
